  "body_html": "<h1>lp_weak_duality</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem lp_weak_duality (A : I → Fin n → 𝕜) (b : I → 𝕜) (c : Fin n → 𝕜) {x : Fin n → 𝕜} (hxA : ∀ i, b i ≤ ∑ j, A i j * x j) (hxnn : ∀ j, 0 ≤ x j) {u : I → 𝕜} (hu_du : DualFeasible A c u) : ∑ i, u i * b i ≤ ∑ j, c j * x j</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>DualFeasible</li>\n</ul>",
